nt-normal opacity-85">· uses a little of your usage</span></button><p class="mt-1.5 text-[11px] leading-snug text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Mark an area for a local edit. The previous version is kept below.</p></section><section class="space-y-2" aria-label="Page objects"><h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[var(--ds-ink)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-image-plus size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 5h6"></path><path d="M19 2v6"></path><path d="M21 11.5V19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h7.5"></path><path d="m21 15-3.086-3.086a2 2 0 0 0-2.828 0L6 21"></path><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"></circle></svg> Page objects</h3><p class="text-[12px] leading-5 text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Place an uploaded image as a movable layer. The page drawing stays intact.</p><input accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/gif,image/avif,image/svg+xml,.svg" hidden="" aria-label="Upload an image object" type="file"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[var(--ds-surface-soft)] font-medium hover:bg-[var(--ds-hover)] transition-all duration-[var(--ds-motion-medium)] ease-[var(--ds-ease)] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[color:var(--ds-focus)] contrast-more:focus-visible:outline-[3px] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-45 text-[var(--ds-ink)] h-7 px-2.5 text-[11.5px] coarse:h-10 tap-target"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-image-plus size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 5h6"></path><path d="M19 2v6"></path><path d="M21 11.5V19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h7.5"></path><path d="m21 15-3.086-3.086a2 2 0 0 0-2.828 0L6 21"></path><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"></circle></svg> Upload image</button><p class="text-[12px] text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Upload an image to place it here.</p></section><section aria-label="Page actions" class="space-y-2"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-wrap gap-2" role="group" aria-label="Another take or a saved version"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[var(--ds-surface-soft)] font-medium hover:bg-[var(--ds-hover)] transition-all duration-[var(--ds-motion-medium)] ease-[var(--ds-ease)] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[color:var(--ds-focus)] contrast-more:focus-visible:outline-[3px] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-45 text-[var(--ds-ink)] h-8 px-3 text-[12px] coarse:h-11 coarse:min-w-[44px] coarse:px-3.5 min-w-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rotate-ccw h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"></path><path d="M3 3v5h5"></path></svg> <span class="shrink-0">Try another take</span><span class="min-w-0 truncate text-[var(--ds-muted)]">uses a little of your usage</span></button><button type="button" data-testid="pick-versions" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[var(--ds-surface-soft)] font-medium hover:bg-[var(--ds-hover)] transition-all duration-[var(--ds-motion-medium)] ease-[var(--ds-ease)] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[color:var(--ds-focus)] contrast-more:focus-visible:outline-[3px] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-45 text-[var(--ds-ink)] h-8 px-3 text-[12px] coarse:h-11 coarse:min-w-[44px] coarse:px-3.5 min-w-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-layers h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z"></path><path d="M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12"></path><path d="M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17"></path></svg> <span class="truncate">Pick from 2 versions</span><span class="shrink-0 font-semibold text-[var(--ds-success-text)]">Free</span></button><button type="button" title="Place the balloons again automatically (balloons you moved stay put) — free" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[var(--ds-surface-soft)] font-medium hover:bg-[var(--ds-hover)] transition-all duration-[var(--ds-motion-medium)] ease-[var(--ds-ease)] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[color:var(--ds-focus)] contrast-more:focus-visible:outline-[3px] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-45 text-[var(--ds-ink)] h-8 px-3 text-[12px] coarse:h-11 coarse:min-w-[44px] coarse:px-3.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-type h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4v16"></path><path d="M4 7V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h14a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v2"></path><path d="M9 20h6"></path></svg> Re-letter</button></div></section><section aria-labelledby="pe-qc"><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><h3 id="pe-qc" class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold leading-4 tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-[var(--ds-muted)]"><span class="shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg></span><span class="truncate">Quality check</span></h3><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-[11px] tabular-nums text-[var(--ds-muted)]">match 82%</span></div></div><ul class="space-y-1"><li class="flex gap-2 rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[12px] leading-snug text-[var(--ds-ink)] border-[color:color-mix(in_srgb,var(--ds-warning)_40%,transparent)] bg-[color:color-mix(in_srgb,var(--ds-warning)_8%,transparent)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-[var(--ds-warning-text)]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Arjun’s beard is missing in panel 3</span></li></ul><p class="mt-1.5 text-[11px] text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Tip: describe a fix above, or mark the area and let the AI correct just that.</p></section><section aria-labelledby="pe-versions" class="scroll-mt-2"><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><h3 id="pe-versions" class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold leading-4 tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-[var(--ds-muted)]"><span class="shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-layers h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z"></path><path d="M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12"></path><path d="M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17"></path></svg></span><span class="truncate">Versions</span></h3><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-[11px] text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Switching is free</span></div></div><div class="min-w-0 space-y-2"><div class="flex min-w-0 items-start gap-3"><div class="relative w-24 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[var(--ds-well)]" style="aspect-ratio: 0.6666666666666666; max-height: 150px;"><img alt="Page 1, version 1" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-contain" draggable="false" src="https://cdn.test/u/proj/pages/p1.png"></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 space-y-1.5"><span class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1"><span data-badge="" class="inline-flex min-w-0 max-w-full items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-1.5 py-px text-[10.5px] font-semibold leading-4 bg-[var(--ds-accent-soft)] text-[var(--ds-ink)]"><span class="min-w-0 truncate">v1 of 2 · current</span></span></span><p class="truncate text-[11.5px] text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Not recorded · QC 0.82</p><button type="button" disabled="" class="tap-target inline-flex h-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl bg-[var(--ds-accent-fill)] px-4 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[var(--ds-on-accent)] hover:bg-[var(--ds-accent-fill-hover)] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-45 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[color:var(--ds-focus)] contrast-more:focus-visible:outline-[3px]">Current version</button></div></div><div role="radiogroup" aria-label="Page 1 versions" class="flex min-w-0 gap-1.5 overflow-x-auto overscroll-x-contain py-2 [scrollbar-width:thin]"><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="true" tabindex="0" data-version="1" aria-label="v1, current" class="tap-target relative shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border bg-[var(--ds-well)] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[color:var(--ds-focus)] contrast-more:focus-visible:outline-[3px] border-[var(--ds-accent)] ring-1 ring-[var(--ds-accent)]" style="width: 44px; aspect-ratio: 0.6666666666666666; max-height: 66px;"><img alt="" loading="lazy" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-contain" draggable="false" src="https://cdn.test/u/proj/pages/p1.png"><span class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 py-px text-center text-[9px] font-semibold text-white bg-[var(--ds-accent)]">v1</span></button><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" tabindex="-1" data-version="2" aria-label="v2" class="tap-target relative shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border bg-[var(--ds-well)] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[color:var(--ds-focus)] contrast-more:focus-visible:outline-[3px] border-[var(--ds-hairline)] hover:border-ds-accent/50" style="width: 44px; aspect-ratio: 0.6666666666666666; max-height: 66px;"><img alt="" loading="lazy" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-contain" draggable="false" src="https://cdn.test/u/proj/pages/p1.png.old"><span class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 py-px text-center text-[9px] font-semibold text-white bg-black/55">v2</span></button></div><div class="pointer-events-none fixed inset-x-0 z-[55] flex justify-center px-4" style="bottom: calc(var(--sa-bottom-eff, 0px) + 16px);" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="pe-script" class="space-y-2"><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><h3 id="pe-script" class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold leading-4 tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-[var(--ds-muted)]"><span class="shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-square h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 17a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6.828a2 2 0 0 0-1.414.586l-2.202 2.202A.71.71 0 0 1 2 21.286V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg></span><span class="truncate">Script</span></h3></div><div class="min-w-0"><label for="_r_1v_" class="mb-0.5 block px-2 text-[11px] font-medium text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Page summary</label><textarea rows="2" id="_r_1v_" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-transparent px-2 py-1 coarse:min-h-[44px] text-[var(--ds-ink)] placeholder:text-[var(--ds-faint)] hover:border-[var(--ds-hairline)] focus:border-[var(--ds-focus)] focus:bg-[var(--ds-surface-strong)] focus:outline-none transition-all duration-[var(--ds-motion-medium)] ease-[var(--ds-ease)] text-base sm:text-[13.5px] coarse:text-base resize-none leading-relaxed" style="height: auto;">Page 1 summary</textarea></div><div class="min-w-0"><label for="_r_20_" class="mb-0.5 block px-2 text-[11px] font-medium text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Layout (rows of panels)</label><textarea rows="2" id="_r_20_" placeholder="Row 1: one wide panel. Row 2: two equal panels." class="w-full rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-transparent px-2 py-1 coarse:min-h-[44px] text-[var(--ds-ink)] placeholder:text-[var(--ds-faint)] hover:border-[var(--ds-hairline)] focus:border-[var(--ds-focus)] focus:bg-[var(--ds-surface-strong)] focus:outline-none transition-all duration-[var(--ds-motion-medium)] ease-[var(--ds-ease)] text-base sm:text-[13.5px] coarse:text-base resize-none leading-relaxed" style="height: auto;">Row 1: one wide panel (panel 1). Row 2: two equal panels side by side (panels 2–3).</textarea></div><p class="px-2 text-[11px] leading-snug text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Dialogue edits update the balloons instantly — no redraw needed. Layout and action edits mark the page out of date.</p><div class="space-y-2"><section aria-label="Panel 1" class="rounded-2xl border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[var(--ds-surface-soft)] p-2.5"><header class="mb-1 flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2"><span class="grid h-5 w-5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[var(--ds-well-strong)] text-[10.5px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[var(--ds-muted)]">1</span><p class="min-w-0 truncate text-[11.5px] text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Wide · Establishing · no one</p></header><details class="mb-1.5 min-w-0 text-[12px]"><summary class="w-fit cursor-pointer py-1.5 text-[var(--ds-ink)] coarse:min-h-[44px] coarse:py-3">Camera</summary><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2"><label class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1 text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Shot size<select class="h-7 min-w-0 rounded-lg border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[var(--ds-surface-strong)] px-1.5 text-[12px] text-[var(--ds-ink)] focus:border-[var(--ds-accent)] focus:outline-none disabled:opacity-50 coarse:h-11 min-w-0"><option value="establishing">Establishing</option><option value="wide">Wide</option><option value="full">Full shot</option><option value="medium">Medium</option><option value="close_up">Close-up</option><option value="extreme_close_up">Extreme close-up</option><option value="over_shoulder">Over the shoulder</option><option value="insert">Insert</option><option value="pov">POV</option></select></label><label class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1 text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Camera angle<select class="h-7 min-w-0 rounded-lg border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[var(--ds-surface-strong)] px-1.5 text-[12px] text-[var(--ds-ink)] focus:border-[var(--ds-accent)] focus:outline-none disabled:opacity-50 coarse:h-11 min-w-0"><option value="">Auto</option><option value="eye level">Eye level</option><option value="low angle">Low angle</option><option value="high angle">High angle</option><option value="bird's-eye view">Bird’s-eye view</option><option value="worm's-eye view">Worm’s-eye view</option><option value="dutch tilt">Dutch tilt</option></select></label></div><p class="mt-1 text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Saved to the panel plan and used the next time the page is drawn.</p></details><div class="min-w-0"><label for="_r_21_" class="sr-only">Panel 1 action</label><textarea rows="2" id="_r_21_" placeholder="What we see in this panel" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-transparent px-2 py-1 coarse:min-h-[44px] text-[var(--ds-ink)] placeholder:text-[var(--ds-faint)] hover:border-[var(--ds-hairline)] focus:border-[var(--ds-focus)] focus:bg-[var(--ds-surface-strong)] focus:outline-none transition-all duration-[var(--ds-motion-medium)] ease-[var(--ds-ease)] text-[12.5px] resize-none leading-relaxed" style="height: auto;">The spice market at dawn, stalls opening under striped awnings.</textarea></div><div class="mt-1.5 space-y-1.5"><div data-testid="line-row" data-line-id="pg_1_l1" class="space-y-1 rounded-xl border p-1.5 transition-colors duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none border-[var(--ds-accent)] bg-[var(--ds-accent-soft)]"><div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5"><select aria-label="Line type" class="h-7 min-w-0 rounded-lg border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[var(--ds-surface-strong)] px-1.5 text-[12px] text-[var(--ds-ink)] focus:border-[var(--ds-accent)] focus:outline-none disabled:opacity-50 coarse:h-11 w-[7.5rem] shrink-0"><option value="speech">Speech</option><option value="thought">Thought</option><option value="whisper">Whisper</option><option value="shout">Shout</option><option value="caption">Caption</option><option value="sfx">Sound effect</option></select><select aria-label="Speaker" disabled="" class="h-7 min-w-0 rounded-lg border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[v