ut!" class="ds-lettering-balloon"><g transform="translate(20 103.13)"><path d="M33.51 64.18L46.2 103.52L69 69.04Z" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="5.04" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></g><g transform="translate(20 103.13)"><path d="M113.3 39.26L118.65 44.98L112.56 49.67L116.27 54.84L110.35 57.56L112.25 62.48L106.71 64.38L108.12 69.53L101.69 70.23L103.31 76.35L95.34 75.1L94.49 80.09L87.72 78.96L85.87 84.11L78.84 81.76L76.05 88.06L68.55 83.45L62.44 88.07L55 84.02L47.61 87.75L41.45 83.45L34.48 86.82L31.16 81.76L23.98 84.33L22.28 78.96L15.7 79.9L14.66 75.1L8.6 74.88L8.31 70.23L2.02 69.46L3.29 64.38L-3.83 63.12L-0.35 57.56L-5.46 54.63L-2.56 49.67L-8.03 44.92L-3.3 39.26L-8.83 33.53L-2.56 28.85L-7.19 23.45L-0.35 20.96L-2.98 15.74L3.29 14.14L2.92 9.58L8.31 8.29L7.82 3.04L14.66 3.42L15.08 -2.01L22.28 -0.44L23.34 -6.74L31.16 -3.24L34.78 -7.6L41.45 -4.93L47.59 -9.37L55 -5.5L62.3 -8.68L68.55 -4.93L75.91 -9.21L78.84 -3.24L85.34 -4.83L87.72 -0.44L94.6 -1.68L95.34 3.42L102.06 3.13L101.69 8.29L108.4 8.83L106.71 14.14L113.41 15.57L110.35 20.96L117.32 23.42L112.56 28.85L117.84 33.62Z" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2.52" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></g><g transform="translate(20 103.13)"><path d="M33.51 64.18L46.2 103.52L69 69.04Z" fill="#ffffff" stroke="none"></path></g><g><g><text font-family="&quot;DSL Permanent Marker&quot;, &quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;, &quot;Chalkboard SE&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="20.2" font-weight="400" fill="#111111" x="75" y="136.32" text-anchor="middle">Look</text><text font-family="&quot;DSL Permanent Marker&quot;, &quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;, &quot;Chalkboard SE&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="20.2" font-weight="400" fill="#111111" x="75" y="162.58" text-anchor="middle">out!</text></g></g></g></svg></span></span></span><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-0.5 px-0.5 pb-0.5"><span class="min-w-0 truncate text-[13px] font-medium leading-5 text-[var(--ds-ink)]">Indie handwritten</span></span><span id="_r_2q_" hidden="" data-slot="preset-hint">Hand-drawn wobbly balloons and marker lettering with an indie feel.</span></button></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><button type="button" title="Remove every per-balloon and per-speaker style so the whole comic follows the chosen style" disabled="" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[var(--ds-surface-soft)] font-medium hover:bg-[var(--ds-hover)] transition-all duration-[var(--ds-motion-medium)] ease-[var(--ds-ease)] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[color:var(--ds-focus)] contrast-more:focus-visible:outline-[3px] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-45 text-[var(--ds-ink)] h-7 px-2.5 text-[11.5px] coarse:h-10 tap-target"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rotate-ccw h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"></path><path d="M3 3v5h5"></path></svg> Reset all balloon styles</button></div></section><section aria-labelledby="pe-ai"><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><h3 id="pe-ai" class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold leading-4 tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-[var(--ds-muted)]"><span class="shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wand-sparkles h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.64 3.64-1.28-1.28a1.21 1.21 0 0 0-1.72 0L2.36 18.64a1.21 1.21 0 0 0 0 1.72l1.28 1.28a1.2 1.2 0 0 0 1.72 0L21.64 5.36a1.2 1.2 0 0 0 0-1.72"></path><path d="m14 7 3 3"></path><path d="M5 6v4"></path><path d="M19 14v4"></path><path d="M10 2v2"></path><path d="M7 8H3"></path><path d="M21 16h-4"></path><path d="M11 3H9"></path></svg></span><span class="truncate">Edit with AI</span></h3></div><div class="mb-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Edit type<select class="h-7 min-w-0 rounded-lg border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[var(--ds-surface-strong)] px-1.5 text-[12px] text-[var(--ds-ink)] focus:border-[var(--ds-accent)] focus:outline-none disabled:opacity-50 coarse:h-11"><option value="describe">Describe a change</option><option value="add">Add an object</option><option value="replace">Replace or change an object</option><option value="remove">Remove an object</option></select></label></div><label for="pe-instruction" class="sr-only">What should change?</label><textarea id="pe-instruction" rows="3" placeholder="e.g. “Make it night with lanterns lit” or “Give Maya a red scarf”" class="w-full resize-none rounded-xl border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[var(--ds-surface-strong)] px-3 py-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--ds-ink)] placeholder:text-[var(--ds-faint)] focus:border-[var(--ds-accent)] focus:outline-none disabled:opacity-60 coarse:text-[16px]"></textarea><div class="mt-2 flex min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[var(--ds-surface-soft)] font-medium hover:bg-[var(--ds-hover)] transition-all duration-[var(--ds-motion-medium)] ease-[var(--ds-ease)] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[color:var(--ds-focus)] contrast-more:focus-visible:outline-[3px] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-45 text-[var(--ds-ink)] h-7 px-2.5 text-[11.5px] coarse:h-10 tap-target"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-square-dashed h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2"></path><path d="M19 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2"></path><path d="M21 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2"></path><path d="M5 21a2 2 0 0 1-2-2"></path><path d="M9 3h1"></path><path d="M9 21h1"></path><path d="M14 3h1"></path><path d="M14 21h1"></path><path d="M3 9v1"></path><path d="M21 9v1"></path><path d="M3 14v1"></path><path d="M21 14v1"></path></svg> Mark an area</button><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[var(--ds-surface-soft)] font-medium hover:bg-[var(--ds-hover)] transition-all duration-[var(--ds-motion-medium)] ease-[var(--ds-ease)] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[color:var(--ds-focus)] contrast-more:focus-visible:outline-[3px] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-45 text-[var(--ds-ink)] h-7 px-2.5 text-[11.5px] coarse:h-10 tap-target">Circle an object</button><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Where<select aria-label="Panel to change" class="h-7 min-w-0 rounded-lg border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[var(--ds-surface-strong)] px-1.5 text-[12px] text-[var(--ds-ink)] focus:border-[var(--ds-accent)] focus:outline-none disabled:opacity-50 coarse:h-11"><option value="">Whole page</option><option value="1">Panel 1</option><option value="2">Panel 2</option><option value="3">Panel 3</option></select></label></div><button type="button" disabled="" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl font-semibold bg-[var(--ds-accent-fill)] hover:bg-[var(--ds-accent-fill-hover)] text-[var(--ds-on-accent)] transition-all duration-[var(--ds-motion-medium)] ease-[var(--ds-ease)] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[color:var(--ds-focus)] contrast-more:focus-visible:outline-[3px] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-45 h-9 px-4 text-[13px] coarse:h-11 coarse:min-w-[44px] mt-3 w-full min-w-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wand-sparkles h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.64 3.64-1.28-1.28a1.21 1.21 0 0 0-1.72 0L2.36 18.64a1.21 1.21 0 0 0 0 1.72l1.28 1.28a1.2 1.2 0 0 0 1.72 0L21.64 5.36a1.2 1.2 0 0 0 0-1.72"></path><path d="m14 7 3 3"></path><path d="M5 6v4"></path><path d="M19 14v4"></path><path d="M10 2v2"></path><path d="M7 8H3"></path><path d="M21 16h-4"></path><path d="M11 3H9"></path></svg> <span class="shrink-0">Apply edit</span><span class="min-w-0 truncate font-normal opacity-85">· uses a little of your usage</span></button><p class="mt-1.5 text-[11px] leading-snug text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Mark an area for a local edit. The previous version is kept below.</p></section><section class="space-y-2" aria-label="Page objects"><h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[var(--ds-ink)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-image-plus size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 5h6"></path><path d="M19 2v6"></path><path d="M21 11.5V19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h7.5"></path><path d="m21 15-3.086-3.086a2 2 0 0 0-2.828 0L6 21"></path><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"></circle></svg> Page objects</h3><p class="text-[12px] leading-5 text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Place an uploaded image as a movable layer. The page drawing stays intact.</p><input accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/gif,image/avif,image/svg+xml,.svg" hidden="" aria-label="Upload an image object" type="file"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[var(--ds-surface-soft)] font-medium hover:bg-[var(--ds-hover)] transition-all duration-[var(--ds-motion-medium)] ease-[var(--ds-ease)] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[color:var(--ds-focus)] contrast-more:focus-visible:outline-[3px] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-45 text-[var(--ds-ink)] h-7 px-2.5 text-[11.5px] coarse:h-10 tap-target"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-image-plus size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 5h6"></path><path d="M19 2v6"></path><path d="M21 11.5V19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h7.5"></path><path d="m21 15-3.086-3.086a2 2 0 0 0-2.828 0L6 21"></path><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"></circle></svg> Upload image</button><p class="text-[12px] text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Upload an image to place it here.</p></section><section aria-label="Page actions" class="space-y-2"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-wrap gap-2" role="group" aria-label="Another take or a saved version"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[var(--ds-surface-soft)] font-medium hover:bg-[var(--ds-hover)] transition-all duration-[var(--ds-motion-medium)] ease-[var(--ds-ease)] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[color:var(--ds-focus)] contrast-more:focus-visible:outline-[3px] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-45 text-[var(--ds-ink)] h-8 px-3 text-[12px] coarse:h-11 coarse:min-w-[44px] coarse:px-3.5 min-w-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"